{"unit_id":"erty3244__dsh-self-trigger#card-zh","repo":"erty3244/dsh-self-trigger","commit":"9aa94cb9195953f9719044141284d3612d81b599","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-self-trigger 是一款面向 DSH 的主动会话插件：它监听会话活动，并按本地策略周期检查是否触发。命中后会从动作权重中抽取行为，向配置的目标会话注入一条提示；规则层支持活跃时段、每日次数、连续失败概率和动作抽签。策略文件默认关闭，用户可配置目标会话、时间与次数等参数。适合希望在空闲时给 agent 一个自主行动机会的 DSH 用户。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:82-93","lib/index.js:121-160","lib/rules.js:44-89"]}
{"unit_id":"erty3244__dsh-self-trigger#card-en","repo":"erty3244/dsh-self-trigger","commit":"9aa94cb9195953f9719044141284d3612d81b599","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-self-trigger is a proactive DSH plugin. It checks a local policy periodically and injects a weighted action prompt into a chosen session when its rules fire. Rules include active hours, a daily cap, and rising trigger probability after misses. The policy is disabled by default.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:82-93","lib/index.js:121-160","lib/rules.js:44-89"]}
