{"unit_id":"erty3244__dsh-self-trigger#feature-1","repo":"erty3244/dsh-self-trigger","commit":"9aa94cb9195953f9719044141284d3612d81b599","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-self-trigger 的「空闲策略判定」功能：按启用状态、活跃时段、每日上限和连续失败概率判断是否触发；宿主每分钟检查策略并按配置周期执行判定。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:121-160","lib/rules.js:44-74"]}
