{"unit_id":"erty3244__dsh-self-trigger#caveat-1","repo":"erty3244/dsh-self-trigger","commit":"9aa94cb9195953f9719044141284d3612d81b599","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-self-trigger 默认关闭，启用后会把生成的提示交给目标会话并可能触发模型调用；预算作为提示内容传入，入口代码未见插件侧预算强制截断逻辑。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:24-26","lib/index.js:95-118"]}
